{"id":"8663f071280951f9","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/618_相似性反事实逻辑.md","title":"618 相似性反事实逻辑","display":"618_相似性反事实逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{cf},\\quad\\operatorname{sim}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{cf},\\quad\\operatorname{sim}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{618},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{cf}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{618},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sim}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sim}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\square\\!\\!\\to B=\\operatorname{cf}(A,B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\square\\!\\!\\to B=\\operatorname{cf}(A,B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\preceq_A C=\\operatorname{sim}(A,B,C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\preceq_A C=\\operatorname{sim}(A,B,C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\square\\!\\!\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\">\\(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\preceq_A C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\">\\(B\\preceq_A C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<p>自由变元：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(B\\preceq_A C)=\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(B\\preceq_A C)=\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{618}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限支撑替换集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{618}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{618}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{618}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{618}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{618}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{618}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中替换扩张为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\square\\!\\!\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\square\\!\\!\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(B\\preceq_A C)=\\widehat\\sigma(B)\\preceq_{\\widehat\\sigma(A)}\\widehat\\sigma(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(B\\preceq_A C)=\\widehat\\sigma(B)\\preceq_{\\widehat\\sigma(A)}\\widehat\\sigma(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{618}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{618}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,618}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,618}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{618}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{618}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{618}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{618}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{618}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{618}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{618}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{618}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反事实与相似性公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CFK}^{618}\n=\n\\{(A\\square\\!\\!\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{CFK}^{618}\n=\n\\{(A\\square\\!\\!\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimRefl}^{618}\n=\n\\{B\\preceq_A B:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimRefl}^{618}\n=\n\\{B\\preceq_A B:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimTrans}^{618}\n=\n\\{((B\\preceq_A C)\\land(C\\preceq_A D))\\to(B\\preceq_A D):A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimTrans}^{618}\n=\n\\{((B\\preceq_A C)\\land(C\\preceq_A D))\\to(B\\preceq_A D):A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimCF}^{618}\n=\n\\{((B\\preceq_A C)\\land(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B))\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimCF}^{618}\n=\n\\{((B\\preceq_A C)\\land(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B))\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{618}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{618}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{618}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{618}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{618}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CFK}^{618}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimRefl}^{618}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimTrans}^{618}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimCF}^{618}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{618}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{618}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{618}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{618}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{618}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CFK}^{618}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimRefl}^{618}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimTrans}^{618}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimCF}^{618}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则关系\">5. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{618}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{618}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCF}^{618}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCF}^{618}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{618}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{618}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCF}^{618}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{618}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{618}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCF}^{618}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{618}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{618}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>组成的集合，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\)</span>，并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{618}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{618}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{618}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{618}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCF}^{618}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCF}^{618}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\)</span>，定义末行函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{618,\\Gamma}:\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{618}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{618,\\Gamma}:\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{618}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{618}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{618}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{618,\\Gamma}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{618,\\Gamma}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记上述末行函数族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{618}\n=\n(\\operatorname{last}_{618,\\Gamma})_{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{618}\n=\n(\\operatorname{last}_{618,\\Gamma})_{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{618}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{618}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{618,\\Gamma}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{618}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{618}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{618,\\Gamma}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{618}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{618}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{618}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{618}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-相似性语义\">8. 相似性语义</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"618\">\\(618\\)</span>-相似性模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SimMod}_{618}\">\\(\\mathsf{SimMod}_{618}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>。公式真值集</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦-⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句递归定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg A⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg A⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A\\to B⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A\\to B⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A\\square\\!\\!\\to B⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Sel}(w,⟦ A⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq⟦ B⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A\\square\\!\\!\\to B⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Sel}(w,⟦ A⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq⟦ B⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ B\\preceq_A C⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\n\\operatorname{Sel}(w,⟦ A⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M})\\cap⟦ B⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}\n\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{Sel}(w,⟦ A⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M})\\cap⟦ C⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ B\\preceq_A C⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\n\\operatorname{Sel}(w,⟦ A⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M})\\cap⟦ B⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}\n\\subseteq\n\\operatorname{Sel}(w,⟦ A⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M})\\cap⟦ C⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足与语义后承为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{618}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in⟦ A⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{618}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in⟦ A⟧_{618}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{618}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{SimMod}_{618}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{618}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{618}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{618}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{SimMod}_{618}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{618}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{618}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本系统除反事实构造子外还引入三元相似性公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\preceq_A C\">\\(B\\preceq_A C\\)</span>，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimRefl}^{618}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimRefl}^{618}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimTrans}^{618}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimTrans}^{618}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimCF}^{618}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{SimCF}^{618}\\)</span> 约束它。该三元构造子使本条目区别于 Lewis 系列仅含二元反事实条件的条目。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-结构说明\">10. 结构说明</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\preceq_A C\">\\(B\\preceq_A C\\)</span> 是对象语言公式构造子；本文件没有引入世界之间的相似序或相似球语义。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{SimCF}_{618}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{618},\\operatorname{FV}_{618},\\operatorname{BV}_{618},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{618},\\operatorname{Sub}_{618},\\equiv_{\\alpha,618},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{618},\\mathsf{Rule}_{618},\\mathsf{Proof}_{618},\\operatorname{last}_{618},\\vdash_{618},\\mathsf{Thm}_{618},\n\\mathsf{SimMod}_{618},⟦-⟧_{618},\\Vdash_{618},\\models_{618}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{SimCF}_{618}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{618},\\operatorname{FV}_{618},\\operatorname{BV}_{618},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{618},\\operatorname{Sub}_{618},\\equiv_{\\alpha,618},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{618},\\mathsf{Rule}_{618},\\mathsf{Proof}_{618},\\operatorname{last}_{618},\\vdash_{618},\\mathsf{Thm}_{618},\n\\mathsf{SimMod}_{618},⟦-⟧_{618},\\Vdash_{618},\\models_{618}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含反事实与相似性公式、公理、证明关系、选择式相似性语义与语义后承；不在本条目中断言可靠性或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则关系","text":"5. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-相似性语义","text":"8. 相似性语义","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-结构说明","text":"10. 结构说明","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{cf},\\quad\\operatorname{sim}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{618},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sim}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{618}\\times\\